alwaysApply: true
---
description: "FastAPI processing service standards"
globs: ["services/processor/**/*.py"]
---
# Types and contracts
- Every public function needs full type annotations (params + return)
- Use Pydantic v2 BaseModel for all API input/output
- No `Any` unless accompanied by `# TODO: reason`

# Async and I/O
- I/O operations must be async def (model inference, file I/O, FFmpeg calls)
- FFmpeg calls use asyncio.create_subprocess_exec. No shell=True
- Model inference runs in an executor or dedicated thread pool. Do not block the event loop

# Errors
- No bare except. Catch specific exceptions or log and re-raise a domain error
- Failures return structured errors (errorCode + userMessage). Never return stack traces

# Model management
- Lazy-load models. Do not load everything at startup
- Check input dimensions before inference. Reject oversized inputs instead of attempting them
